        ['id' => 'usa', 'eyebrow' => 'United States', 'h' => 'USMLE after MBBS in China: the route to the USA', 'p' => [
            "Many students start an MBBS with the United States in mind. The route is well known, demanding and competitive. It is possible for graduates of Chinese universities, but it needs long preparation, strong scores and a realistic plan.",
