        ['id' => 'honest', 'eyebrow' => 'Honest view', 'h' => 'An honest view of your chances', 'p' => [
            "Graduates of Chinese universities pass licensing examinations, get registered and build good careers at home and abroad. Others take longer than they hoped, or need more than one attempt. The difference is usually preparation, not luck: steady study, strong clinical years, good language skills and a clear plan.",
