        ['Is XJMU recognised by PMDC and NMC?', 'XJMU is listed by WHO (WDOMS) and recognized by PMDC, NMC and other councils for licensing. Councils update their lists and conditions, so check the council\'s current list before you rely on it.'],
        ['What is NExT, and has it replaced FMGE?', 'NExT, the National Exit Test, is an examination the NMC has planned for both Indian and foreign medical graduates, intended to replace the FMGE. Its timing has changed more than once, so follow the NMC\'s official announcements.'],
